---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Origin Story"
  description="How Chari got here — from electrical engineering to full-stack dev to indie game maker in training."
>
  <PageHeader eyebrow="ORIGIN STORY" title="How this character got here" />

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I studied Electrical and Computer Engineering at the University of
      Thessaly, which is a roundabout way of saying I learned to debug circuits
      before I ever debugged code. These days I work as a full-stack developer
      on a maritime platform for seafarers — Angular on the front, Java and
      Quarkus on the back, PostgreSQL underneath, Keycloak guarding the door.
    </p>

    <h2>The other campaign</h2>
    <p>
      Alongside the day job, I'm building toward something else: solo indie
      games rooted in Greek mythology and history. Not as a side hobby that
      stays a hobby — as an actual second career I'm building one evening and
      weekend at a time, until it can stand on its own.
    </p>

    <h2>The rules I play by</h2>
    <p>
      Everything I build, on either side of that line, follows the same three
      rules:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Indie</strong> — built solo, transparently, without hiding behind
        a brand.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Ethical</strong> — no dark patterns, no manipulative pricing, no pretending
        trackers are "analytics".
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Fun</strong> — if it's not intrinsically enjoyable to build or use,
        it's not worth building.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      This site is itself a small proof of that philosophy — no analytics script
      running in the background, no cookie banner because there's nothing to
      disclose, no newsletter popup between you and the content.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
